				<r3d:description language="eng">The Ocean Data Platform (ODP) gives ocean data scientists and researchers a single place to access, analyze, and share world ocean data — public, private, scientific, and industrial — in one unified environment. The integrated integrated catalog, user-controlled workspaces, and powerful APIs and SDKs enable advanced analytics, large-scale computation, and seamless cross-dataset harmonization. Collaborate with teams, publish high-quality datasets, and spend less time on data wrangling. Uniquely, the ODP unlocks industrial ocean data rarely available to researchers and will integrate high-resolution survey data from REV Ocean&#039;s state-of-the-art research vessel launching in 2027. The Ocean Data Platform is built by the non-profit HUB Ocean.</r3d:description>
